meta {
  name: Download TACOTS onboarding
  type: http
  seq: 16
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/tacots/download/tacotsonboarding
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Download TACOTS Onboarding (CSV Export)
  
  Exports the entire `tacots_onboarding` table as a CSV file download. Selects all rows from the table (no filters, no pagination) and converts the records to CSV using json2csv, and returns the CSV as raw file bytes with Content-Type: text/csv and Content-Disposition: attachment. The response is not JSON; frontend clients should read it as a Blob and trigger a browser download.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires authentication (`authenticate()`) and `"read"` permission (`authorize("read")`).
  
  ## Request
  No path parameters, query parameters, or request body.
  
  ## Response — `200 OK`
  
  **Content-Type:** `text/csv; charset=utf-8`
  **Content-Disposition:** `attachment; filename="tacots_onboarding.csv"`
  
  The CSV contains one row per onboarding record with the following columns (in order):
  
  | Column | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID primary key |
  | `studentId` | UUID foreign key referencing the TACOTS recommendation |
  | `onboardingDate` | Date the student was onboarded |
  | `hasMentalHealthDiagnosis` | Whether the student has a mental health diagnosis |
  | `diagnosedConditions` | Diagnosed mental health conditions (if any) |
  | `behavioralIndicators` | Observed behavioral indicators |
  | `focusAbilityRating` | Rating of the student's ability to focus |
  | `emotionalStabilityRating` | Rating of emotional stability |
  | `peerInteractionRating` | Rating of peer interaction skills |
  | `receivedCounseling` | Whether the student has received counselling |
  | `needsSpecialSupport` | Whether the student needs special support |
  | `mentalHealthNotes` | Additional mental health notes |
  | `generalHealthStatus` | General health status |
  | `immunizationStatus` | Immunisation status |
  | `hasChronicCondition` | Whether the student has a chronic condition |
  | `chronicConditions` | Chronic conditions (if any) |
  | `allergies` | Known allergies |
  | `requiresMedication` | Whether the student requires medication |
  | `physicalActivityLevel` | Level of physical activity |
  | `physicalLimitations` | Physical limitations (if any) |
  | `additionalHealthNotes` | Additional health notes |
  | `enrolledSchoolName` | Name of the enrolled school |
  | `enrolledSchoolTown` | Town of the enrolled school |
  | `enrolledSchoolLga` | LGA of the enrolled school |
  | `enrolledSchoolState` | State of the enrolled school |
  | `enrolledClass` | Class the student was enrolled into |
  | `termResumptionDate` | Date of term resumption |
  | `schoolFeesPerTerm` | School fees per term |
  | `studentCommitment` | Student's commitment declaration |
  | `parentGuardianCommitment` | Parent/guardian commitment declaration |
  | `parentSignatureUrl` | Cloudinary URL for parent signature |
  | `parentSignaturePublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for parent signature |
  | `admissionLetterUrl` | Cloudinary URL for admission letter |
  | `admissionLetterPublicId` | Cloudinary public ID for admission letter |
  | `programOfficerNotes` | Notes from the programme officer |
  | `supportTypesApproved` | Types of support approved |
  | `mentorName` | Name of assigned mentor |
  | `sponsorName` | Name of assigned sponsor |
  | `additionalInfo` | Any additional information |
  | `updatedAt` | Last update timestamp |
  | `createdAt` | Creation timestamp |
  | `deletedAt` | Soft-delete timestamp (null if active) |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description |
  |--------|-------------|
  | `401 Unauthorized` | Missing or invalid access token / refresh token. |
  | `403 Forbidden` | User lacks the `"read"` permission. |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error. |
}
